From: Matthieu Baerts (NGI0) <matttbe@kernel.org>
Subject: [PATCH] Revert "kbuild: make all file references relative to source root"

This reverts commit cacd22ce69585a91c386243cd662ada962431e63.

This causes issues with GCOV, objdump -S and all tools using it or
reading the same thing, e.g. addr2line, decode_stacktrace.sh, etc.

The author asked to have this patch reverted.

Link: https://lore.kernel.org/5e996ded-2325-48b5-9cde-972b70e0934a@t-8ch.de
Signed-off-by: Matthieu Baerts (NGI0) <matttbe@kernel.org>
